      "type": "explain",
      "title": "A dot adds half",
      "text": [
        "A dot after a note makes it half as long again. A half note is two beats, so a **dotted half note** is three.",
        "Count **1 2 3** while it rings."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/h. B4/q"]
      },
